    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Liiulwa lia Koku",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne ewe mwana wo mundu, ng'oola busiku khu Koku olome kano: Omwami WELE aloma ali, “Lola Ese nakhweanyilekho ee Koku, omwami owa Roshi, Mesheki ne Tubali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Ese ndakhuyuusia mala khuyile ebweeni, mala khurusie khukhwama aleeyi mu bibala bie bunaswa, lundi khuraangirire wibwaakale bikulu bia Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ese ndapa buyiingo bwowo bukwe khukhwama mu mukhono kwowo kumukhasi, lundi khole buembo bwowo bukwe khukhwama mu mukhono kwowo kumuseecha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhafwiile khu bikulu bia Isiraeli, ewe alala ne banamae bowo boosi ne chikholo chiili alala ne nawe. Khakhuane khu nyuni nende buli solo chikhulie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhafwiile mu lukoongo, sikila Ese Omwami WELE nalomaloome. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khayile kumulilo khu Makoku nende khwaabo bamenyile mu muleembe mu bibala bie khu nyanja; mala bakhamanye bali Ese ndi Omwami Wele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Ese khakhole lisina liase litakatifu limanyikhe mu Baisiraeli base. Ne se khalekhe lisina liase litakatifu lifwolobisibwe lundi tawe. Ne chikholo chikhamanye chili Ese ndi Omwami Wele, Omutakatifu owa Isiraeli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwami WELE aloma ali, “Lola endaalo elikho yiicha mala elareerwa. Yino niyo endaalo niyo nalomalomakho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono babaandu ba baamenya mu ngoba cha Isiraeli balarura bache babuusie boosie bulwaani buulekhiilwe. Bakhosie chingabo, buyiingo, buembo, kamafumo ne chiruungu. Bakhabiore khulwe kimiiko saba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Se bakhareenye chiikhu mundaa namwe bareme lwosi lwosi khukhwama mu musiru tawe, sikila bakhabwaane bulwaani nibwo baalekha nga chiikhu. Balayaaya bibiindu bia abo babayaaya ne khunuula. Omwami WELE aalomile.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lisiikhwa lia Koku",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Khu ndaalo eyo, Ese khaelesie Koku abuundu e khumusiikha mu Isiraeli; litooma lia Be khu Lukeendo, ebukwe we Nyanja eya chumbe, ekhakhinge engila eye babaandu be khu lukeendo, sikila Koku ne banamae bewe bakali bakhasiikhwe abwenao. Akhalaangwe, ‘Litooma lia Hamoni Koku.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sikila khu mieesi saba Baisiraeli bakhabe balikho basiikha bafu khulwe khukhweya khukwalaasia sibala.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwami WELE aloma ali, “Babaandu boosi be mu sibala bakhayeete khubasiikha mala bakhaelesibwe lukoosi khu ndaalo niyo Ese khekeseliekho luyali lwase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakharobore babaandu be siseecha bache babire mu sibala sioosi busiele ne basiikha bafu ba baaba ne barama mu sibala nio basikwalaasie. Khu mieesi saba bakhakhole bario. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne nga bano bakhabire mu sibala mwoosi, ne omundu yesi yesi ne abona sikuumba sio mundu araao simanyisio, khukhwola nga abo basiikha ne basisiikha mu Litooma Hamoni koku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Lukoba Hamona lwosi luliyo) Khwako bakheye sibala sikwalaale sirio.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
